@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
title Activity navigation - open mixed selection
actor Teacher
participant "Native activity page" as Activity
participant "activity_navigation" as Navigation
participant "Native Settings form" as Form
participant "module_form" as Selection

Teacher -> Activity : Open Folder / File activity
Activity -> Navigation : Extend settings navigation
Navigation -> Navigation : Check module, capabilities and enabled profiles
Navigation --> Activity : Reuse related materials entry
note over Activity, Navigation
On the separate Folder Edit page,
save or cancel pending changes before leaving.
end note
Teacher -> Activity : Choose Reuse related materials
Activity -> Form : Native modedit route; coursebridge=1 and section fragment
Form -> Selection : Native module-form callbacks
Selection -> Selection : Check writable control and current authority
Selection --> Form : Expanded reuse section and current draft scope
Teacher -> Form : Select, review and add materials
note over Activity, Form : Native Save / Cancel owns permanent activity changes.
@enduml
